t moody may affect crew.\n\nI think we can recommend Candidate B as provisional, citing strengths and acknowledging concerns.\n\nWe need to reference discussion: there is none yet, but we can say \"Given the criteria, I propose...\"\n\nWe must include at least one fact per candidate? Not required, but we need to give evidence.\n\nWe need to state vote in metadata.\n\nLet's produce public message: propose Candidate B, explain strengths: conscientious (reliability), handles stress (stress resilience), good weather assessment (technical), but concerns: weak memory for numbers (attention), pretentious (crew cooperation). Conclude still best overall.\n\nOk."}
